{"name":"main","commit":{"sha":"354c98cbab303131573c47a4aa39ded8c579dbb3","node_id":"C_kwDOC7X7R9oAKDM1NGM5OGNiYWIzMDMxMzE1NzNjNDdhNGFhMzlkZWQ4YzU3OWRiYjM","commit":{"author":{"name":"Badr NASS LAHSEN","email":"badr.nasslahsen@gmail.com","date":"2026-09-06T19:58:51Z"},"committer":{"name":"Badr NASS LAHSEN","email":"badr.nasslahsen@gmail.com","date":"2026-09-06T19:58:51Z"},"message":"security: stop pre-filling OAuth2 credentials in the MCP dashboard\n\nThe security panel shipped with a token endpoint, a client id and a client secret\nalready in the fields. That reads as a working configuration, so pressing Get Token\nposted default-client:default-secret to whatever endpoint was in the box, and the\ndefault endpoint was plaintext http. The operator now supplies all three; the fields\ncarry hints, and a non-loopback http endpoint says the secret would travel in the\nclear.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"997fdb38ecae01772c3f1676d8e36718ace2dbbe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/springdoc/springdoc-openapi/git/trees/997fdb38ecae01772c3f1676d8e36718ace2dbbe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/springdoc/springdoc-openapi/git/commits/354c98cbab303131573c47a4aa39ded8c579dbb3","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/springdoc/springdoc-openapi/commits/354c98cbab303131573c47a4aa39ded8c579dbb3","html_url":"https://github.com/springdoc/springdoc-openapi/commit/354c98cbab303131573c47a4aa39ded8c579dbb3","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/springdoc/springdoc-openapi/commits/354c98cbab303131573c47a4aa39ded8c579dbb3/comments","author":{"login":"bnasslahsen","id":13404829,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNDA0ODI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13404829?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bnasslahsen","html_url":"https://github.com/bnasslahsen","followers_url":"https://api.git